UUID: 895e2382-8724-3ae3-9bfb-54e4af37b0ca
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (furnace), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_895e2382-8724-3ae3-9bfb-54e4af37b0ca.xml</text>
